    "image_with_text_YFy6rM": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "subheading_4W4pwU": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Bulk Candles for Sale: Shop & Save Now",
            "subheading_tag": "h2",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "border_7FLkyj": {
          "type": "border",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "text_G7eEn9": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Buying in quantity doesn’t mean you have to sacrifice quality. Kisco Candles offers candles in bulk that deliver both value and craftsmanship. Perfect for weddings, corporate events, religious ceremonies, restaurant tablescapes, or home decor setups, our bulk selection allows you to cut costs without cutting corners.</p><p>Our collection includes a wide range of candle types—<a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/votive-candles\" title=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/votive-candles\">votives</a>, <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/pillar-candles\" title=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/pillar-candles\">pillar candles</a>, taper candles, <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/floating-candles\" title=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/floating-candles\">floating candles</a>, and tea lights—each made with premium wax and clean-burning wicks. These candles burn evenly and look great in any setting. Our unscented candles are ideal for dining areas, allergy-sensitive guests, and settings where fragrance-free ambiance is a must.</p><p>Large orders are shipped quickly and arrive ready to use. With simple ordering and competitive pricing, stocking up is stress-free. When quality matters and savings count, Kisco Candles delivers bulk options that check every box.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "subheading_4W4pwU",
        "border_7FLkyj",
        "text_G7eEn9"
      ],
      "custom_css": [
