        },
        "border_KTCKpR": {
          "type": "border",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "text_dGaKhT": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Kisco Candles works closely with event professionals, venues, and hospitality buyers to provide dependable wholesale candles that elevate the atmosphere of every space. Our candles are great for banquet halls, dining rooms, outdoor receptions, and wedding venues.</p><p>Instead of mass-market packaging or flashy labels, we focus on refined presentation, long burn times, and clean finishes. From tall tapers that frame a ceremony aisle to bulk pillars used in centerpieces, we provide candles that enhance décor without overpowering the scene.</p><p>Wedding planners, restaurateurs, hotel managers, and everyday customers planning their own special occasions choose our candles for their timeless appearance and practical performance. With fast shipping and reliable inventory, you can confidently order what you need, when you need it.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "subheading_8AQM3k",
        "border_KTCKpR",
