    "image_with_text_eaeQPm": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "subheading_jEM6Mj": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Kisco Candle Quality: What Sets Us Apart",
            "subheading_tag": "h2",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "border_8eAATQ": {
          "type": "border",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "text_kk6b6g": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Kisco Candles is built on a simple promise—high-quality candles, every time. No shortcuts. No cheap blends. Each of our candles starts with carefully selected wax, clean-burning cotton wicks, and form-stable finishes that resist dripping and uneven melting.</p><p>Our quality doesn’t change based on order size. A single box or a full pallet receives the same attention to detail. Candle edges are smooth, surfaces are polished, and sizing is accurate—essential for consistent table layouts, event staging, or decorative alignment. The result is a candle that performs as beautifully as it looks.</p><p>Professionals in the hospitality and event space rely on us to deliver consistency and style. From ceremony backdrops to dinner table lighting, our candles help create the setting without becoming a distraction. We design for form and function—clean burn, elegant look, no fuss.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "subheading_jEM6Mj",
        "border_8eAATQ",
        "text_kk6b6g"
