    "image_with_text_8L9zwi": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "subheading_DNr9dh": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Bulk Candles for Every Season and Style",
            "subheading_tag": "h2",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "border_4XqmXg": {
          "type": "border",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "text_FwbmAN": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Kisco Candles offers a full range of wholesale candles in different shapes, sizes, and finishes to match any event style or décor theme. From modern minimalism to classic elegance, our collection supports every aesthetic.</p><p>Our <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/unscented-candles\" title=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/unscented-candles\">unscented candles</a> are perfect for dining tables, enclosed venues, and events where fragrance could interfere with food or guest comfort. Choose from pillars,floating, <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/taper-candles\" title=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/taper-candles\">taper candles</a>, and <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/tealights\" title=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/tealights\">tea lights</a> to suit your setting. Whether you're lighting an outdoor reception or adding ambiance to an upscale restaurant, the right candle style makes all the difference.</p><p>We keep a steady inventory year-round. From a single room to a multi-table venue, you can count on uniform quality and finish across your entire order.</p><p>Event designers, caterers, and private hosts turn to Kisco for candles that look polished, burn clean, and enhance the visual impact of their setups, without stealing the spotlight.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        }
