            "text": "<p>Buying bulk candles is a well-kept secret among those who love adding a touch of class to their spaces. Imagine having a steady supply of these beauties,<strong> ready to light up your events or decorate your space without stretching your budget.</strong> Bulk purchases save you money and ensure you're never short on candles for those special moments. Plus, the creative possibilities are endless! From crafting a mesmerizing centerpiece to setting a romantic mood, <strong>bulk candles like the </strong><a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/wholesale-bulk-candles/products/2x3-2x4-2x6-bulk-pillar-candles-wholesale-candles?variant=40690346459245\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>2” pillar candles</strong></span></a><strong> offer both practicality and a classic design.</strong></p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        }
      },
