          }
        },
        "border_i6tgzQ": {
          "type": "border",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "text_hUYJ6B": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>When it comes to bulk candle shopping, there's a reason savvy buyers turn to Kisco’s Bolsius candles. It's all about quality. <strong>Think dripless candles with cotton wicks that promise a clean, steady burn every time. </strong>Kisco doesn’t just stop at quality; we’ve mastered the art of aesthetics. Their <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/wholesale-bulk-taper-candles\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">bulk taper candles</span></a> are functional and a feast for the eyes, fitting seamlessly into any design theme. Whether you're lighting them for ambiance or routine décor, Kisco's wholesale candles are a perfect choice.<br/><br/></p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
