    "rich_text_ccb93b": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "spacer_atjF66": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 28
          }
        },
        "heading_RMqNcD": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Tips for Buying Wholesale Candles in Bulk",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "heading_font_class": "fs-heading-3-base"
          }
        },
        "border_yzk8QB": {
          "type": "border",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "text_BNfhHV": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Accurately estimating the number of candles needed when planning for an event ensures ambiance without crowding. Consider the event's size, duration, and the desired candle arrangements. Bulk purchases with Kisco Candles mean enjoying wholesale candle prices on high-quality <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/bolsius-candles\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Bolsius candles,</span></a> suitable for dozens of events and venues. This allows you to focus on both aesthetic appeal and budget efficiency simultaneously.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_QAyyJJ": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 28
          }
        },
        "heading_chBx6Y": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "The Benefits of Buying Wholesale Candles",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "heading_font_class": "fs-heading-3-base"
          }
        },
        "spacer_YbKmgU": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 12
          }
        },
        "text_bergHm": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Purchasing items in bulk, particularly for businesses or event planning, is a strategic decision that brings multiple benefits. It leads to substantial cost savings, allowing for budget allocation to other essential areas. Another key advantage is that consistency across all products ensures a uniform experience for users or attendees, enhancing overall satisfaction. It's better to be overstocked than not to have enough. The convenience of having extra supplies on hand caters to unforeseen circumstances, ensuring things run smoothly without the need for last-minute arrangements. This approach not only optimizes resources but also guarantees peace of mind.  </p><p>Buying wholesale candles, whether in <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/pillar-candles\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">pillar</span></a> variety or the unique <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/ball-candles\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">round ball shape</span></a>, gives you:</p><ul><li><strong>Budget Relief: </strong>Get more for your buck. You can get a discount in bulk savings and not worry about stretching your dollar. </li><li><strong>Consistent Design: </strong>Buying bulk orders of Bolsius candles means you get uniform quality across the board. Anticipate the long-lasting benefits of Bolsius from each and every candle. </li><li><strong>Safety in Numbers: </strong>It is always best to bring more than you need. If you have leftovers, store your favorite candles for another event in the future. </li></ul>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_FHCCUt": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 12
          }
        },
        "heading_LciEqx": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Bulk Candles Are Perfect for Every Occasion",
            "heading_tag": "h3",
            "heading_font_class": "fs-heading-3-base"
          }
        },
        "text_hVyHHc": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Bulk candles from Kisco are a versatile solution for any candle need. Are you planning a grand wedding? Check. Are you organizing an intimate dinner party? Covered. Maybe you're just a candle enthusiast looking to stock up. Perfect. <strong>These candles are not just for special events but also ideal for everyday elegance. </strong>There's something for every preference and occasion, with options ranging from classic taper to <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/wholesale-bulk-floating-candles\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">decorative floating candles</span></a>. Don't forget the <a href=\"https://kiscocandles.com/collections/votive-candles\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">votive candles</span></a>, which bring a timeless shape to your design and are a guaranteed staple at any event. Whether you're a venue manager or a small business owner, our wholesale candles<strong> </strong>are the perfect solution for consistent quality at scale.<br/>Shop Kisco's diverse collections and find the ideal <strong>bulk candle options to illuminate your events or add that special glow to your home.</strong></p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_jmAgWL": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 36
          }
        }
      },
