            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-5-base"
          }
        },
        "text_y6Nnxf": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We invite you to experience the beauty and savings our wholesale candles offer. <strong>Explore our extensive collection and discover how bulk buying can be cost-effective and creatively fulfilling. </strong>From elegant taper candles at intimate dinners to robust pillar candles for large gatherings, Kisco has you covered. Shop Kisco's bulk candles and transform your spaces into places of warmth and charm</p>",
