    "custom_liquid_hkXN7H": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "t:sections.custom_liquid.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n  \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n  \"@type\": \"FAQPage\",\n  \"mainEntity\": [\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What types of bulk candles do you offer?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"We offer several of the most popular bulk candle types, including taper, pillar, floating, and tea light candles. This gives you a practical place to start if you need bulk candles but still want to compare formats before deciding on the final order.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"How do I choose the right candle type for my event or business?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Choose pillar candles for more height and presence, taper candles for formal table settings, floating candles for bowls and vase displays, and tea lights for compact accent lighting. The right format usually depends on the vessel, the burn-time needs, and how much visual impact you want from the candle itself.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Who is this bulk candle category best for?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"This category is a strong fit for event planners, stores, venues, hospitality buyers, and customers who need larger quantities of candles at better value. It also works well for customers who want to compare several candle types before moving into a more specific product category.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What colors are most common in your bulk candle selection?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"White and ivory are the most common bulk candle colors we carry, with limited red options in selected products. These shades are the easiest to use across weddings, restaurants, churches, memorial settings, and classic décor themes.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What size range do your bulk candles cover?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Our bulk candle assortment covers small accent candles through taller event candles, so you can shop for everything from tea lights and floating candles to larger pillars and tapers in one place. That makes it easier to plan a mixed candle order for a full event or venue setup.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Is this the right place to start if I am not sure which candle style I need?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes. This is the best place to start when you know you need candles in bulk but still need to compare the main formats. Once you know the look and function you need, it becomes much easier to narrow the order to pillars, tapers, floating candles, or tea lights.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"What is the advantage of buying candles in bulk?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Buying in bulk helps reduce the cost per candle and makes planning easier when you need repeat quantities in matching colors and sizes. It is especially helpful for weddings, venues, restaurants, and stores that need consistent presentation across a larger order.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Do you offer wholesale support for larger candle orders?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes. We support larger candle orders for customers who want better pricing, easier reordering, and a more efficient purchasing process. That is especially useful for planners, businesses, and repeat buyers who order candles regularly.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Can I create a mixed order with multiple candle types?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Yes. Many customers combine candle types, so each space gets the format that works best. A single event may use pillar candles for focal points, floating candles for water displays, and tea lights for smaller accents.\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"@type\": \"Question\",\n      \"name\": \"Why buy wholesale candles from Kisco Candles?\",\n      \"acceptedAnswer\": {\n        \"@type\": \"Answer\",\n        \"text\": \"Kisco Candles makes it easier to source coordinated candle products for events, business use, and repeat ordering. Customers shop with us when they want strong value, dependable product selection, and a cleaner way to manage larger candle orders.\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n</script>",
        "divider_style": "none",
        "section_padding": "section--vertical-padding-top-bottom"
      }
    },
    "rich_text_p7D8ce": {
      "type": "rich-text",
      "blocks": {
        "spacer_L8mYri": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 40
          }
        },
        "heading_MrGjAB": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Bulk Candles FAQs: Everything You Need to Know",
            "heading_tag": "h2",
            "heading_font_class": "fs-heading-3-base"
          }
        },
        "border_JMAjFR": {
          "type": "border",
          "settings": {}
        },
        "text_phgQQw": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>In the world of candle buying, going for bulk Bolsius candles often raises a few questions. To help you make the most informed choices, we’ve gathered some common queries about Kisco’s bulk candles.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-100"
          }
        },
        "spacer_6THxWy": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 12
          }
        },
        "subheading_jRWLhL": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "What types of bulk candles do you offer?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-6-base"
          }
        },
        "text_cVFhCr": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We offer several of the most popular bulk candle types, including taper, pillar, floating, and tea light candles. This gives you a practical place to start if you need bulk candles but still want to compare formats before deciding on the final order.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        },
        "spacer_ykeVbb": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 16
          }
        },
        "subheading_fVaWkq": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "How do I choose the right candle type for my event or business?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-6-base"
          }
        },
        "text_xVMDY7": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Choose pillar candles for more height and presence, taper candles for formal table settings, floating candles for bowls and vase displays, and tea lights for compact accent lighting. The right format usually depends on the vessel, the burn-time needs, and how much visual impact you want from the candle itself.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        },
        "spacer_68L9WH": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 16
          }
        },
        "subheading_63Jihh": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Who is this bulk candle category best for?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-6-base"
          }
        },
        "text_dttHE3": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>This category is a strong fit for event planners, stores, venues, hospitality buyers, and customers who need larger quantities of candles at better value. It also works well for customers who want to compare several candle types before moving into a more specific product category.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        },
        "spacer_zbiA3h": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 16
          }
        },
        "subheading_YnWqLz": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "What colors are most common in your bulk candle selection?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-6-base"
          }
        },
        "text_HcQMNY": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>White and ivory are the most common bulk candle colors we carry, with limited red options in selected products. These shades are the easiest to use across weddings, restaurants, churches, memorial settings, and classic décor themes.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        },
        "spacer_7QXgMW": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 40
          }
        },
        "subheading_qmrwmQ": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "What size range do your bulk candles cover?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-6-base"
          }
        },
        "text_rTtzDg": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Our bulk candle assortment covers small accent candles through taller event candles, so you can shop for everything from tea lights and floating candles to larger pillars and tapers in one place. That makes it easier to plan a mixed candle order for a full event or venue setup.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        },
        "spacer_pM7qme": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 16
          }
        },
        "subheading_fUHL3x": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Is this the right place to start if I am not sure which candle style I need?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-6-base"
          }
        },
        "text_Wrzzii": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Yes. This is the best place to start when you know you need candles in bulk but still need to compare the main formats. Once you know the look and function you need, it becomes much easier to narrow the order to pillars, tapers, floating candles, or tea lights.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        },
        "spacer_kG4meU": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 16
          }
        },
        "subheading_hQgFMi": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "What is the advantage of buying candles in bulk?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-6-base"
          }
        },
        "text_ty4JL6": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Buying in bulk helps reduce the cost per candle and makes planning easier when you need repeat quantities in matching colors and sizes. It is especially helpful for weddings, venues, restaurants, and stores that need consistent presentation across a larger order.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        },
        "spacer_UCenz4": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 16
          }
        },
        "subheading_j4nDFy": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Do you offer wholesale support for larger candle orders?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-6-base"
          }
        },
        "text_NmcTaG": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Yes. We support larger candle orders for customers who want better pricing, easier reordering, and a more efficient purchasing process. That is especially useful for planners, businesses, and repeat buyers who order candles regularly.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        },
        "spacer_wh9wKK": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 16
          }
        },
        "subheading_7zDWan": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Can I create a mixed order with multiple candle types?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-6-base"
          }
        },
        "text_NWn44U": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Yes. Many customers combine candle types, so each space gets the format that works best. A single event may use pillar candles for focal points, floating candles for water displays, and tea lights for smaller accents.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        },
        "spacer_axXNiQ": {
          "type": "spacer",
          "settings": {
            "space": 16
          }
        },
        "subheading_hCaemK": {
          "type": "subheading",
          "settings": {
            "subheading": "Why buy wholesale candles from Kisco Candles?",
            "subheading_tag": "h3",
            "subheading_font_class": "fs-heading-6-base"
          }
        },
        "text_hpcj7d": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Kisco Candles makes it easier to source coordinated candle products for events, business use, and repeat ordering. Customers shop with us when they want strong value, dependable product selection, and a cleaner way to manage larger candle orders.</p>",
            "text_font_class": "fs-body-75"
          }
        }
      },
